# Ref-books index (PLAN-REF-BOOKS-UPGRADE-v2 cards · v3 stance)

Before designing an algorithm, data layout, or schedule change:

1. Run `python src/dev/ref_books_index/lookup.py --brief <file>`
2. Cite the matrix row id in the commit message when you adopt a book idea
3. Follow `src/dev/plan_ref_books_upgrade_v2.md` §0–§1 (one slice, Recon first, no second authority)
4. Ledger: update `src/dev/ref_books_index/adoption.tsv` only (`ADOPTED` requires production `file:line`; else `UNWIRED` / `BLOCKED`)
5. Honest exits: `src/dev/plan_ref_books_upgrade_v3.md` §0.1 — stop and report when a slice cannot be wired honestly
6. DEFER/PARTIAL triggers: `src/dev/plan_ref_books_defer_unlock_v1.md`

Do not paste matrix content into rules/skills — query `lookup.py` / `matrix.md` live.